WEBVTT

00:17:27.834 --> 00:17:31.805
čiju gradsku zastavu Sjeveroameričko 
veksilološko društvo smatra

00:17:31.805 --> 00:17:36.681
najgorom zastavom u Sjevernoj Americi.

00:17:36.681 --> 00:17:40.920
(Smijeh) (Pljesak)

00:17:44.111 --> 00:17:46.247
Da.

00:17:46.247 --> 00:17:50.148
Ovo čudo ima simbol 
trademarka. (Smijeh)

00:17:50.148 --> 00:17:53.840
Sami pogled na to mi je bolan.

00:17:53.840 --> 00:17:55.860
Hvala vam na pažnji.

00:17:55.860 --> 00:18:01.628
(Pljesak)